window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>After having my life turned upside down, I discovered past me had left more than one thing that needed fixing.</p> <p>Past me was awesome.</p> <p>Saved by an angel, protected by him and the three other men I love, I learn there's more to the mystery of my past lives than I ever could have realized.</p> <p>With danger around every corner, wrongs from a long-forgotten past, and more betrayal than I ever thought possible, I try to realign a world gone awry.</p> <p>Can we survive all that is to come?</p> <p><b>Contains mature themes.</b></p>"; 
